  "editorial": {
    "name": "urbicon ui",
    "descriptionZh": "面向 Svelte 5 与 Tailwind 4 的组件库，主打零依赖，并额外提供 urbicon CLI 与 llms.txt 这类给 AI 工具读的入口。",
    "takeawayZh": "用 urbicon CLI 拉 Svelte 5 组件，39 个原语都不引第三方依赖。",
    "noteZh": "顶栏一行小字写 UI PLATFORM FOR SVELTE 5 + TAILWIND 4，导航是 Components、Recipes、Getting started 加 GitHub 外链与 ⌘K 搜索。首屏左边大标题 urbicon ui，下面一句 depends on nothing，再下面小字 Everything in it was made in it.；右边压着一块橙色面板叫 Blocks，副标题写 39 primitives, 45 components, 0 dependencies，旁边是 Show the parts 按钮。橙色面板上方嵌了一个酒店后台示例，标题 Fermata / All three houses，带 Overview、Rooms、Flow 三段切换和 All、Cala、Firn、Duna 房型筛选，下面有 Arrivals this week 堆叠面积图、Revenue by room type 环形图和 Take same-day arrivals 开关。页面下半是一个组件索引，最上面是 Filter 100 components 输入框与 A2UIView、Accordion、AccountSettings 等条目。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "Free",
    "pricingNote": null
  },
